abstract: "Reproducibility package for the accompanying study on covariance scaling
  and a dual-mode torque diagnostic in measurements of the gravitational
  constant. Contains the curated input datasets, the shared statistical
  implementation, the executable analyses, the regression tests, and the
  generators for every figure and table in the manuscript. Running
  reproduce.py --core regenerates the primary results; --full and --archive
  add supplementary and archival analyses, including the full Bayesian
  simulation-based calibration."